WEBVTT

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:03.165
A busy diary can still hide an unready decision

00:00:04.047 --> 00:00:07.231
Start with what you already know then follow Daniel

00:00:07.310 --> 00:00:11.152
through one fictional working day You may already organise

00:00:11.152 --> 00:00:15.113
meetings and pass on messages A full calendar does

00:00:15.126 --> 00:00:17.336
not tell us whether the right people have the

00:00:17.428 --> 00:00:21.060
right papers or whether a change was approved This

00:00:21.073 --> 00:00:25.152
unit connects those familiar tasks into a reliable executive-support

00:00:25.244 --> 00:00:25.928
partnership
